{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208390","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1120839001:1":{"text":"Superb, the venom worked perfectly. You're all too honest.","source_cn":"很好、很好，毒液起效果然很快。你们是很有诚信的人，在考...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23595ACDD8091A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120839002:1":{"text":"So thanks for all your help thus far!","source_cn":"这一路上，真是“辛苦”你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x053BCDE11AB8785A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1120839002":{"text":"So thanks for all your help thus far!","source_cn":"这一路上，真是“辛苦”你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x053BCDE11AB8785A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120839003:1":{"text":"Indeed. Your shovels were coated with the venom you gave me from the first trial. How's it working?","source_cn":"没错，铁锹上面涂着你们在第一道考验时搜集的诡蛛毒液……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC17C7787B94193B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120839005:1":{"text":"This treasure was so hard to find. Why would I want to share it?","source_cn":"我好不容易藏起来的珍宝，怎么能分享给别人呢，呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BC6771804A9DC00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120839006:1":{"text":"Lord Pike... This treasure... You buried it here?","source_cn":"老、老爷……这里的珍宝，是你藏起来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFCFB3C7A2F5E411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120839007:1":{"text":"That's right. We spread rumors that treasure was buried in the Crimson Highlands, but when our workers started excavating, they actually did find gems.","source_cn":"没错，虽然深红高原埋有宝藏的传闻是我们散播出去的，可我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A3A20C062452CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120839008:1":{"text":"Beautiful blood-red gems... as numerous as seeds in a pomegranate... But then the evacuation order came down, and I didn't have time to take them!","source_cn":"鲜血一样美丽深邃的宝石，石榴籽那么多的残阳之眼……但我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69788C59E657C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120839009:1":{"text":"I got rid of the workers who discovered them and buried the gems here... Wouldn't it have been a waste if those gems stayed buried here where no one could enjoy them?","source_cn":"我处理了挖出宝石的劳工，匆忙将宝石埋在这里……名贵之物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8A035302871756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120839010:1":{"text":"Rumors of treasure, workers, evacuation order....? No! What are you talking about?","source_cn":"宝藏的传闻，监工，撤离命令……？不不不，你在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8AC88E3EF46DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1120839010":{"text":"Rumors of treasure, workers, evacuation order....? No! What are you talking about?","source_cn":"宝藏的传闻，监工，撤离命令……？不不不，你在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8AC88E3EF46DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120839011:1":{"text":"As you wish. It's been a long journey, and I'm tired.","source_cn":"也好，这一路走来，我也累了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E62EC534B720E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1120839012:1":{"text":"Lord Pike takes off his disguise...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE5DDBA1ECF08383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120839013:0":{"text":"He's from the Adamant Syndicate!","source_cn":"他……他是黑金的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC76E394347226227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120839014:1":{"text":"Alright, so next...","source_cn":"好了，那么接下来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61506F618FC67671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120839015:1":{"text":"What's going on?! I can't move my arms...!","source_cn":"呃……！怎么回事！为什么我的手动不了了……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4D02B62B46AFC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120839016:1":{"text":"Oops! So let me tell you something, Lord Pike. When you <style=\"highlight\">faked being poisoned</style> just now, I seem to have given you snake venom instead of the neutralizer!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，老爷！不得了了，您刚才<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DB022802C986102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120839017:1":{"text":"Over here, furry friends. I saved the last of the neutralizer for us. Drink that and you'll be good as new.","source_cn":"来，仓鼠老弟，最后的中和剂我给咱们自己留着呢。喝下去就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D18747D023D80C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120839018:1":{"text":"What?! You...!","source_cn":"什……你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x618F2BCCA8443A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120839019:1":{"text":"No! I can't fail! You'll never get away with this!","source_cn":"我、我怎么能在这时候失败？！我绝不会放过你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3B0AE46DE99E8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Show us your true face, Pike.","source_cn":"露出你的真面目吧，荒矛","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4F53B6AFBECBF91","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Show us your true face, Pike.","female":"Show us your true face, Pike.","variant_male_record_index":"63902","variant_female_record_index":"63903","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"There's no need to pretend.","source_cn":"都到这个时候了，不必再伪装","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x025F958C31FC70ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There's no need to pretend.","female":"There's no need to pretend.","variant_male_record_index":"63904","variant_female_record_index":"63905","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"You put venom on our tools?","source_cn":"你在挖掘工具上涂了毒？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80EFA83F5BDF57D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You put venom on our tools?","female":"You put venom on our tools?","variant_male_record_index":"63896","variant_female_record_index":"63897","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120839004:1":{"text":"Indeed. Your shovels were coated with the venom you gave me from the first trial. How's it working?","source_cn":"没错，铁锹上面涂着你们在第一道考验时搜集的诡蛛毒液……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDAD3D54A9227705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"You're an awful person...","source_cn":"你果然不是好人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED011D369530F112","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're an awful person...","female":"You're an awful person...","variant_male_record_index":"63898","variant_female_record_index":"63899","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"Why did you poison us?","source_cn":"为什么要下毒？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8C02E4FB84B1B2B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why did you poison us?","female":"Why did you poison us?","variant_male_record_index":"63900","variant_female_record_index":"63901","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:荒矛":{"text":"Pike","source":"荒矛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德":{"text":"Odie","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金成员荒佐斯":{"text":"Arazos","source":"黑金成员荒佐斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":4}}